  unitName: War Declaration Teresa
  unitId: 830958
  unitNumber: 8637
  description: "The shotguns that Teresa used to punish the wicked had almost no
    recoil, and could shoot bullets at a terrifying speed. She took out the ruffians
    of the band she had once belonged with incredible ease, and yet not a single
    one of their bullets ever managed to hit her\u2014a miracle rewarding her faith.
    Once Teresa made sure that the young woman wielding the relic guns had won against
    the false messenger of the gods, she set off on a journey with her. The legends
    of the \"fighting nun\" heard of in various regions today are said to have begun
    around that time."
  summonDesc: That was a close one, don't you think?<br>But fear not, for the gods
    forgive<br>all of our sins in this sanctuary.
  fusionDesc: It's time to repent!<br>So if you don't want your head to be blown
    clean off,<br>you better start confessing!
  evoDesc: You don't believe I'm a nun?<br>Then why else would I be dressed like
    this?<br>O ye of little faith, there might be no saving you.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
